  "description": "<p>This area rug brings the wild outdoors into your living space with a unique Bigfoot design. Featuring a detailed Sasquatch pattern, this rug adds personality and a touch of adventure to any room. It is designed for both durability and comfort, making it a functional and cozy addition to your home décor.</p><h3>Product Highlights</h3><ul>\n<li>Features a unique and detailed Bigfoot Sasquatch design.</li>\n<li>Offers a soft surface for a comfortable underfoot feel.</li>\n<li>Includes a non-slip backing for enhanced safety.</li>\n<li>Easy to maintain with simple cleaning methods.</li>\n<li>Adds rustic charm to various indoor settings.</li>\n</ul><h3>Specifications</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Attribute</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rug Form</td>\n<td>Area Rug</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Item Shape</td>\n<td>Rectangular</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weave Type</td>\n<td>Machine-Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pile Height</td>\n<td>Low Pile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Construction Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Indoor/Outdoor Usage</td>\n<td>Indoor</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pattern</td>\n<td>Bigfoot</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Theme</td>\n<td>Bigfoot</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Style</td>\n<td>Rustic</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Number of Pieces</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Material &amp; Care</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Item</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Detail</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Type</td>\n<td>Sponge - Memory Foam</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Backing Material</td>\n<td>High-quality Epoxy</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Care Instructions</td>\n<td>Spot Clean Only</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Where It Works</h3><p>This area rug is suitable for enhancing the aesthetic of living rooms, bedrooms, and cabins. Its durable and comfortable design makes it a versatile choice for adding a unique touch to various indoor environments.</p>",
